    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad8024b6b815e32d5456e252",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………\n──训练员、天狼星，\n你们能跟着我来吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ef5c267d6741defdc2765cc24af1e017c9359e7110057ce4b9555e50cb009fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067802.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:905e1d13fa31cd15eb008935",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在里见光钻父亲的请托下，\n我们今天负责带交换视察团参观学园。\n他们似乎都是法国的训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "414a1da350b99bad2815eb598328df17a18f3ee7528e6cc10a526b1eae9d15e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067802.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee10b916c473554ccb19f151",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见光钻带我们来到的地方是东京赛场。\n在URA职员的陪同下，\n我们获准进入部分区域。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7be19f6d4e13aa1ab326a459141ac88da6ed9f669c73104cba354f1d9ce64ebe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067802.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1489790052f3a9004dfc127d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec317440b52f89fbdfad76110a7afc3ac55b01c91d67997968e5ba969bc9ea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
