      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。我会研发出模拟国外远征的\nVR赛马娘模拟器软件！",
      "source_fingerprint": "155e9ef4ed69aaa408ed745e1bb1e08e13b807b9119654262d8295d78e80694f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
