    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ccbc99c3c7e186f7e87885c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "透过跟视察团交流让我明白，\n在国外远征的时候，许多赛马娘\n都会因为不习惯环境而无法发挥实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "937bc2de1886845d08363004aea559c900496c07744fdad3653a6ddb24cc6ee5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
