      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──我想让这样不利的状况消失。\n所以我才想做出\n能够用来熟悉远征地环境的工具！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2e023377d2e05ad216970c5e11699ad9d8adaa792dbe612c84d75533fa7a1b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
