      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈哈，你的想法还是这么惊奇！\n是想用赛马娘模拟器来完美重现当地的\n训练跟比赛环境吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "26655e220a59e114001acf4276214c7f1d69a79ed72a4f6f99f73713589b712f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
